---
import Verticalgrid from "../assets/Verticalgrid.astro";
---
<section class="relative bg-[#f9f9f9]">
  <div class="relative px-8 py-12 mx-auto max-w-7xl md:px-12 lg:px-8 lg:py-[72px]">
    <div class="text-center max-w-2xl mx-auto">
      <h2 class="text-3xl font-normal tracking-tight text-balance text-black">Benefits for Merchants</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 mt-16 -mx-4 gap-y-10 sm:mx-auto lg:max-w-none md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-x-10 lg:mx-8">
     <div class="flex flex-col p-[0.060rem] rounded-3xl ">
        <div class="h-full p-8 bg-white rounded-3xl border border-gray-500 flex flex-col justify-between">
          <div>
            <h3 class="mt-5">
              <span class="text-2xl font-medium">Omnichannel Loyalty & Gift Card Experience</span>
            </h3>
            <p class="mt-3">Provide a unified customer experience across Lightspeed X (in-store), Shopify (web), and the Appbrew-powered mobile app. Loyalty points, gift cards, and promo codes remain consistent across all channels.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="flex flex-col p-[0.060rem] rounded-3xl ">
        <div class="h-full p-8 bg-white rounded-3xl border border-gray-500">
          <h3 class="mt-5 text-xl text-black">
            <span class="text-2xl font-medium">Data-Driven Campaigns</span>
          </h3>
          <p class="mt-3">Use advanced analytics and customer segmentation from 99minds to run targeted campaigns directly in-app, increasing campaign effectiveness.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="flex flex-col p-[0.060rem] rounded-3xl ">
        <div class="h-full p-8 bg-white rounded-3xl border border-gray-500 flex flex-col justify-between">
          <div>
            <h3 class="mt-5 text-xl text-black">
              <span class="text-2xl font-medium"> Real-Time Sync Across Platforms</span>
            </h3>
            <p class="mt-3">Ensure real-time synchronization of customer data, balances, and redemptions between Shopify, Lightspeed, and the mobile app, reducing errors and improving customer satisfaction.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>



